window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v27-069-51af00e4c6f19569.json"]={sha256:"51af00e4c6f195693997bff96963ea085501d3781a3b0e24fc6dff47b59985d3",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-85d03cc49ee5a4d1","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/resources/getting-started/","title":"MITRE ATT&CK: getting started","titleEn":"MITRE ATT&CK: getting started","publisher":"MITRE","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-069","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-069","related":[{"id":"security-v27-070","referenceUrls":["https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/prc/section2/prc241.htm"],"title":"NIST統計：小樣本偵測率的Wilson下限","titleEn":"NIST statistics: Wilson lower bounds for small-sample detection rates","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付20行矩陣、資料缺口、9項通過證據與失敗分類；所有行為由本機無害資料重播表示。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver the twenty-row matrix, prerequisite gaps, nine passing evidence sets and failure categories, represented by harmless local replay data.","difference":"保存每次測試的二元結果、抽樣規則與失敗樣本，區分觀測比例及未知母體比例。","differenceEn":"Preserve binary outcomes, sampling rules and failures, distinguishing an observed fraction from an unknown population proportion.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["可驗證覆蓋須滿足資料可用及測試成功兩條件；未測、不可測與測試失敗應分開。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 選20項教學行為，16項有對應規則，12項資料先決條件滿足，當中9項通過合成驗證。 已驗證覆蓋9/20=45%；16/20=80%只描述規則標籤存在，不是相同量。","使用雙側95%Wilson區間下端，z=1.96；獨立同分布假設若不成立，不能把重複樣本當更多資訊。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 基準20次獨立合成測試成功18次，p̂=0.9；改變樣本為200次成功180次，比例相同。 下端=[p̂+z²/(2n)−z√(p̂(1−p̂)/n+z²/(4n²))]/[1+z²/n]；n=20得到69.896179%。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Verifiable coverage requires both available data and passing tests; untested, untestable and failed cases remain distinct. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. Select twenty teaching behaviors: sixteen have rules, twelve have required data, and nine of those pass synthetic validation. Verified coverage is 45%; the 80% rule-tag presence describes a different quantity.","Use the lower endpoint of a two-sided 95% Wilson interval with z=1.96; correlated repeats violate the independent-trial interpretation. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. The baseline has eighteen successes in twenty independent synthetic trials; the larger sample has 180 successes in 200 trials. The lower endpoint is [p̂+z²/(2n)−z√(p̂(1−p̂)/n+z²/(4n²))]/[1+z²/n]; n=20 gives 69.896179%.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v27-079","referenceUrls":["https://docs.oasis-open.org/cti/stix/v2.1/os/stix-v2.1-os.html"],"title":"OASIS STIX 2.1：亂序版本接收與同版本衝突隔離","titleEn":"OASIS STIX 2.1: out-of-order version reception and conflicting-version quarantine","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付20行矩陣、資料缺口、9項通過證據與失敗分類；所有行為由本機無害資料重播表示。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver the twenty-row matrix, prerequisite gaps, nine passing evidence sets and failure categories, represented by harmless local replay data.","difference":"以物件ID加modified識別版本，固定來源身份政策，保存不可變歷史；對每次接收輸出advance、stale、duplicate或conflict決策及理由。","differenceEn":"Identify versions by object ID plus modified, pin source-identity policy and preserve immutable history. For each received item, emit advance, stale, duplicate or conflict with an auditable reason.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["可驗證覆蓋須滿足資料可用及測試成功兩條件；未測、不可測與測試失敗應分開。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 選20項教學行為，16項有對應規則，12項資料先決條件滿足，當中9項通過合成驗證。 已驗證覆蓋9/20=45%；16/20=80%只描述規則標籤存在，不是相同量。","STIX 2.1定義物件版本與撤銷；本課衝突隔離為本地接收政策，並非用接收時間替代modified，也不以內容較長決定哪個版本可信。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 五個合成ID各有v1與v2，共10個不同版本；A到D先收v2再v1，E先v1再v2。每ID的v2是已知正確最新版，其中A的v2為撤銷。 按到達覆寫只讓E保持v2，最新版正確率1/5=20%；按版本選擇五個都保持v2，正確率5/5=100%，四個陳舊到達不應倒退狀態。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Verifiable coverage requires both available data and passing tests; untested, untestable and failed cases remain distinct. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. Select twenty teaching behaviors: sixteen have rules, twelve have required data, and nine of those pass synthetic validation. Verified coverage is 45%; the 80% rule-tag presence describes a different quantity.","STIX 2.1 defines object versioning and revocation. Conflict quarantine is an explicit local receiver policy; arrival time must not replace modified, and longer content is not evidence that a competing version is trustworthy. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. Five synthetic IDs each have v1 and v2, totaling ten distinct versions. A through D arrive v2 then v1; E arrives v1 then v2. Each v2 is the known latest version, including revoked A-v2. Arrival-order replacement leaves only E at v2, giving latest-state correctness 1/5=20%. Version-aware selection retains v2 for all five, giving 5/5=100%; four stale arrivals must not regress state.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-b10ac85beeea7332","url":"https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/prc/section2/prc241.htm","title":"NIST/SEMATECH: confidence limits for a proportion","titleEn":"NIST/SEMATECH: confidence limits for a proportion","publisher":"NIST","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-54fd89d412fe1280","url":"https://docs.oasis-open.org/cti/stix/v2.1/os/stix-v2.1-os.html","title":"STIX Version 2.1 OASIS Standard","titleEn":"STIX Version 2.1 OASIS Standard","publisher":"OASIS","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
